                        "name": "Nikhil Ashoka",
                        "email": "a.nikhil@ibm.com",
                        "username": "Nikhil-Ashoka"
                    },
                    "message": "Bmcweb is allowing Operator privilege to perform power on, reboot and power off operations, We should not block it in the GUI.\n\nURL for Power on: /Actions/ComputerSystem.Reset `(privileges::postComputerSystem)`\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/bmcweb/blob/8e4736b3f839ef17285535ccf9ac182f30afc10e/redfish-core/lib/systems.hpp#L3494\n\npostComputerSystem: setting privilege for the URL `(postComputerSystem = privilegeSetConfigureComponents)`\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/bmcweb/blob/8e4736b3f839ef17285535ccf9ac182f30afc10e/redfish-core/include/registries/privilege_registry.hpp#L375\n\nPrivileges of Operator can be checked here `(ConfigureComponents)`:\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/bmcweb/blob/8e4736b3f839ef17285535ccf9ac182f30afc10e/redfish-core/include/privileges.hpp#L237"
                },
